DESCRIPTION:Due to popular demand\, the JLL Hackathon team will be hosting 
	another Gen AI Show and Tell session on Thursday\, July 27th – please do
	 join us!  \nWe will demonstrate real Generative AI <https://jllenterprise
	.newsweaver.com/emeacomms.r6ph57iox6/kzdgkg8l4xi1p7kzk6n96z/external?email
	=true&a=5&p=10869539&t=2628996>  solutions already in use\, so you can see
	 what is possible with this transformative technology! A live Q&A session 
	will follow\, so you can ask anything of team members already using Genera
	tive AI in their work.\nThis is a great opportunity to learn how Generativ
	e AI may help you in your daily work and long-term objectives – and find
	 some inspiration for the upcoming JLL Hackathon <https://jllenterprise.ne
	wsweaver.com/emeacomms.r6ph57iox6/f9r4tmaahux1p7kzk6n96z/external?email=tr
	ue&a=5&p=10869539&t=2628996> . If you have any questions\, please contact 
	jllhackathon@jll.com <mailto:jllhackathon@jll.com> . \n___________________
	_____________________________________________________________ \nMicrosoft 
	Teams meeting \nJoin on your computer\, mobile app or room device \nClick 
	here to join the meeting <https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/a
	p/t-59584e83/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fteams.microsoft.com%2Fl%2Fmeetup-join%2F19
	%253ameeting_NzA0M2NkYTYtOTk2OS00OTU1LWE3M2UtNjIwMDE0ODk2Yzg5%2540thread.v
